 162:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton.c **** /**
 163:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton.c ****  * @brief  ATON global initialization. Initializes clocks and bus interfaces. Must be called before
