2564:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton.c ****  * scheduling modes. In other words, function `LL_ATON_Dma_memcpy()` and its usage are incompatible
2565:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton.c ****  * runtime. Therefore either `memcpy()` should be used in its place or calls to `LL_ATON_Dma_memcpy
2566:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton.c ****  * transformed in a sequence of "epoch blocks" which can be integrated with the ATON runtime (as an
